 runtime.lvm -- Myrissa language runtime

 Language-specific runtime support for Myrissa: managed strings,
 type system runtime, print/println type dispatch, len/size/cstr
 intrinsic lowering, finalizers, unit test runner.

 Platform-agnostic C library primitives (printf, malloc, exit) live
 in the backend runtime (bin/res/backend/x86_64/*_runtime.lvm).
*******************************************************************************/
